  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/sh7IJGc\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lcc22tx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"324\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>你是否想为你的世界添加一些更刺激的Boss战？<br> 本模组的目标是创造史诗级的终局Boss战。</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>目前，这个模组有四个Boss。</p><ul>\n<li><strong>夜之巫妖</strong>，出现在寒冷生物群系中的稀有塔楼中。通过跟随灵魂之星来定位这些塔楼。</li>\n<li><strong>黑曜石巨像</strong>，出现在末地岛屿的稀有结构中。</li>\n<li><strong>地狱之握</strong>，出现在下界的稀有结构中。&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>虚空之花</strong>，出现在世界底部的稀有洞穴中。虚空百合会指引方向。</li>\n<li>在创造模式中，可以通过/summon命令召唤它们。<strong><br><br></strong>视频：</li>\n</ul><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>展示视频由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnVYbd8Kzp442CjJrkWLUKQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">bstylia14</a>提供<br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aHPqlXxutBo?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br>荷兰语展示视频由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY2DW-BuEteaSNNiVDtx6_w\" rel=\"nofollow\">De Verloren Gamer</a>提供</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5SJ0It2lS2E?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><br>展示视频由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZzatJlnTV0nm52cKd9O4iA\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChronoFury</a>提供<br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sd75eBb6u5Q?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br>展示视频由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwbQoKKEOpkG9cIi23EVpUg\" rel=\"nofollow\">CyberWorld</a>提供<br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/p0mufQX4Re8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1FWIecLltFT8ySfeusy30RAh5R36tWVKUvW9p6qo66AU/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">开发路线图</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>常见问题</strong></p><p><strong>你能将这个模组移植到Forge或旧版Minecraft吗？</strong></p><ul>\n<li>好消息！这里有一个非官方移植版本 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>安装方法：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">像安装任何普通的Fabric模组一样安装，依赖如下。\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cardinal-components\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cardinal Components</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>额外致谢：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/Rad233\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rad233</a></strong> + <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/DarkCrystalll\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkCrystalll </a>+</strong><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/ChromaPIE\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChromaPIE&nbsp;</a></strong>提供简体中文翻译</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/oddcrafti\" rel=\"nofollow\">oddcrafti&nbsp;</a></strong>提供繁体中文翻译</p>\n<div style=\"color:#ccc;background-color:#1f1f1f;font-family:Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;font-weight:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:19px\">\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://github.com/alpeerkaraca\" rel=\"nofollow\">alpeerkaraca</a> 提供土耳其语翻译</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc\"><a href=\"https://github.com/unroman\" rel=\"nofollow\">unroman</a> 提供乌克兰语翻译</span></div>\n</div>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforms.gle%252fCNeK58ip6qCVzXiY9\" rel=\"nofollow\">私密反馈（Google表单）</a></p>",
